---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

//Terms of use (C8) - unofficial fan project, public deadlock-api data, no Valve
//affiliation, no warranty. Mirrors the footer disclaimer.
const LAST_UPDATED = '2026-08-19';
const CONTACT = 'privacy@ranklock.app';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of use - RankLock"
  description="Terms of use for RankLock: an unofficial Deadlock fan project on public deadlock-api data, provided as-is, not affiliated with Valve."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
>
  <main class="container" style="padding-top:40px; padding-bottom:64px;">
    <div class="legal">
      <div class="kicker" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Last updated · {LAST_UPDATED}</div>
      <h1 class="h-hero" style="font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,48px); margin-bottom:14px;">Terms of use</h1>
      <p style="font-size:16px; color:var(--text-2); max-width:72ch; margin-bottom:8px;">
        By using RankLock you accept these terms. If you do not accept them, do not use
        the site. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>1. What RankLock is</h2>
      <p>
        RankLock is an unofficial, fan-made statistics project for the game Deadlock. It
        is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Valve Corporation. Deadlock,
        and all related game art and trademarks, are the property of Valve Corporation.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Where the data comes from</h2>
      <p>
        All statistics are computed from public match data provided by the
        <a href="https://deadlock-api.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">deadlock-api</a>
        project. RankLock does not have access to private or non-public game data.
      </p>

      <h2>3. No warranty</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided "as is" and "as available", without any warranty of any kind.
        Statistics are estimates derived from sampled match data: they can be incomplete,
        delayed, or wrong, and they change as patches land and data is recomputed. Do not
        rely on them for anything where accuracy is critical. Availability is not
        guaranteed; the site may change or shut down at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Acceptable use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the site for personal, non-commercial purposes</li>
        <li>Do not scrape or bulk-download the site, and do not hammer the underlying API through it</li>
        <li>Do not misrepresent RankLock statistics as official Valve data</li>
        <li>Do not attempt to disrupt the site or probe infrastructure that is not public</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Content and art</h2>
      <p>
        The written guides and the site's own design are © RankLock. Game art, hero
        likenesses and names are © Valve Corporation and are shown here for identification
        and commentary. If you believe something on the site infringes your rights, email
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a> and it will be reviewed and removed if
        warranted.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Ads and support</h2>
      <p>
        The site is free. It may show Google AdSense ads — for visitors in the EEA, UK and
        Switzerland, ads consent is gathered by Google's own consent message — and there is
        an optional <a href="/support">support</a> route. Ad behavior and cookies
        are covered by the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        These terms may be updated at any time; the date at the top shows the latest
        revision. Continued use of the site after a change means you accept the new terms.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
